---
import EstateLayout from '../../layouts/EstateLayout.astro';
import { lineages } from '../../data/estate';
---
<EstateLayout title="Evolution & Lineage｜GitHub Estate" eyebrow="EVOLUTION / LINEAGE">
  <Fragment slot="heading">
    <h1>Archive 不是垃圾桶。<br />历史应该有继承关系。</h1>
    <p class="lead">治理不是抹掉旧系统，而是说明旧资产如何演化、被谁继承、哪些经验被保留。没有 lineage 的“清理”，很容易把历史证据一起清掉。</p>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="container estate-section">
    <div class="stack">
      {lineages.map((lineage) => (
        <article class="estate-card">
          <div class="card-topline"><div><p class="eyebrow">LINEAGE</p><h2>{lineage.title}</h2></div><span class:list={['estate-chip', lineage.state.includes('NEEDS') ? 'warn' : 'info']}>{lineage.state}</span></div>
          <div class="lineage">
            {lineage.steps.map(([name, meaning], index) => (
              <div class="lineage-step">
                <span class="dot">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <div><strong>{name}</strong><span>{meaning}</span></div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="estate-note">Learning：{lineage.learning}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container estate-section">
    <div class="estate-grid three">
      <article class="estate-card"><p class="eyebrow">KEEP</p><h3>保留有效资产</h3><p>代码、规则、Evidence、release、案例与真实消费者都可能是可继承资产。</p></article>
      <article class="estate-card"><p class="eyebrow">SUCCESSION</p><h3>声明继任关系</h3><p>Deprecated / Superseded 的关键不是贴状态，而是指明 successor 与迁移证据。</p></article>
      <article class="estate-card"><p class="eyebrow">LEARN</p><h3>让历史改变未来</h3><p>只有旧系统留下的 LRN 真正进入下一次设计与 Admission Rule，Evolution 才形成复利。</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</EstateLayout>
